---

<!-- ============ CLIENT PROJECTS ============ -->
<div id="clients" class="bg-[#f7f6f4]">
  <div
    class="flex flex-col gap-3 px-6 pt-14 pb-9 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between sm:px-10 sm:gap-0"
  >
    <div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] text-[#888] uppercase">
      02 — Client Projects
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-120 text-[13px] text-[#555] sm:text-right">
      Delivered under formal contracts — every client listed is available as a
      referee to confirm scope, delivery and professionalism.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- GRM: text left (1.2fr), image right (1fr) -->
  <div class="group grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-6 px-6 py-8 sm:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] lg:gap-12" data-reveal>
    <div class="py-4">
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
        <div
          class="font-xeroda text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.015em] sm:text-[32px]"
        >
          GRM — Grievance Redress Mechanism
        </div>
        <div class="ml-6 text-[11px] whitespace-nowrap tracking-[0.16em] text-[#888]">
          C–01
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 max-w-150 text-sm leading-[1.65] text-[#444]">
        A secure channel for citizens and project beneficiaries to submit
        grievances, complaints and corruption reports — with structured grievance
        management, status tracking and administrative oversight for timely
        resolution and transparency.
      </div>
      <div
        class="mt-7 grid max-w-150 grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-2 text-xs leading-[1.6] text-[#444] sm:grid-cols-2"
      >
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#999] uppercase">Client</span><br />
          Government of Sierra Leone, through Dr. Johnson Mwebaze (Makerere University)
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#999] uppercase">Duration</span><br />
          Aug 2024 – Jan 2025 (5 months)
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#999] uppercase">Type</span><br />
          Accountability &amp; reporting app (Android)
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#999] uppercase">Scope</span><br />
          Submission &amp; tracking · media attachments · role-based admin · secure
          auth · notifications · docs &amp; training
        </div>
      </div>
      <a
        href="#"
        class="mt-7 inline-block border-b border-[#0a0a0a] pb-0.5 text-[11px] tracking-[0.16em] uppercase"
      >
        On Google Play ↗
      </a>
    </div>
    <!-- IMAGE SLOT: GRM app screenshots -->
    <div class="flex min-h-105 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-[#ecece8]">
      <div
        class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.16em] text-[#bbb] uppercase transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
      >
        GRM screenshots
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CHW: image left (1fr), text right (1.2fr) -->
  <div class="group grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-6 px-6 py-8 sm:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-12" data-reveal>
    <!-- IMAGE SLOT: CHW app screenshots -->
    <div
      class="order-2 flex min-h-105 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-[#ecece8] lg:order-1"
    >
      <div
        class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.16em] text-[#bbb] uppercase transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
      >
        CHW screenshots
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="order-1 py-4 lg:order-2">
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
        <div
          class="font-xeroda text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.015em] sm:text-[32px]"
        >
          CHW Training App
        </div>
        <div class="ml-6 text-[11px] whitespace-nowrap tracking-[0.16em] text-[#888]">
          C–02
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 max-w-150 text-sm leading-[1.65] text-[#444]">
        A cross-platform web and mobile app supporting the training of Community
        Health Workers — structured learning content, offline access, progress
        tracking, and administrative tools for monitoring performance and managing
        programs.
      </div>
      <div
        class="mt-7 grid max-w-150 grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-2 text-xs leading-[1.6] text-[#444] sm:grid-cols-2"
      >
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#999] uppercase">Client</span><br />
          GHE Consulting, Kampala — Dr. Joseph B. Babigumira
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#999] uppercase">Duration</span><br />
          Oct 2024 – Feb 2025 (5 months)
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#999] uppercase">Type</span><br />
          Training &amp; learning app (Web, Android &amp; iOS)
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#999] uppercase">Scope</span><br />
          Learning content · offline access · progress tracking · admin tools ·
          docs &amp; training
        </div>
      </div>
      <a
        href="#"
        class="mt-7 inline-block border-b border-[#0a0a0a] pb-0.5 text-[11px] tracking-[0.16em] uppercase"
      >
        Live on the web ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- WalletSense: text left (1.2fr), image right (1fr) -->
  <div class="group grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-6 px-6 py-8 sm:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] lg:gap-12" data-reveal>
    <div class="py-4">
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
        <div
          class="font-xeroda text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.015em] sm:text-[32px]"
        >
          WalletSense AI
        </div>
        <div class="ml-6 text-[11px] whitespace-nowrap tracking-[0.16em] text-[#888]">
          C–03
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 max-w-150 text-sm leading-[1.65] text-[#444]">
        An AI-powered fintech app that learns user spending patterns to suggest the
        most effective ways to save — helping people achieve more from their
        finances. First working version live on Apple's TestFlight.
      </div>
      <div
        class="mt-7 grid max-w-150 grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-2 text-xs leading-[1.6] text-[#444] sm:grid-cols-2"
      >
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#999] uppercase">Client</span><br />
          Emva Group (emvagroup.com) — Emily Mwangi
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#999] uppercase">Duration</span><br />
          Jul 2026
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#999] uppercase">Type</span><br />
          AI fintech app (Web, Android &amp; iOS)
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#999] uppercase">Scope</span><br />
          Architecture · core screens · MVP build · TestFlight iterations · polish
          &amp; delivery
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- IMAGE SLOT: WalletSense screenshots -->
    <div class="flex min-h-105 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-[#ecece8]">
      <div
        class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.16em] text-[#bbb] uppercase transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
      >
        WalletSense screenshots
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
